<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-349] VersionParser does not handle versions like &quot;parquet-mr 1.6.0rc4&quot;</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-349</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m not sure how we missed this one (I thought I added a test for this but apparently not &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/tongue.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;) but the tests don&apos;t cover it, and the parser can&apos;t parse it even though the intention was to support a missing (build abcd) section in the version string.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12849753">PARQUET-349</key>
            <summary>VersionParser does not handle versions like &quot;parquet-mr 1.6.0rc4&quot;</summary>
